From: PS5_Proton
Subject: [PATCH] dwmapi/server: carry DWM surface state and live thumbnails

The audit found DwmSetWindowAttribute and DwmExtendFrameIntoClientArea
returning S_OK while storing nothing, and the thumbnail APIs returning
E_NOTIMPL. dwmapi now validates corner preference, border colour, system
backdrop, dark material and frame margins and sends them through one
win32u call to owner-checked server window state. Thumbnails are bounded
server objects owned by their destination HWND and released with it.
Snapshot v4 exports the resolved radius, shadow, border, glass area and
visible thumbnails. Visual only: regions, hit-testing and window state are
unchanged. A server without these requests keeps the previous stub results.
